      "text": "On q-summation and confluence — 28 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Part 1. Convergent q-Borel and q-L\n\n**On q-summation and confluence**\n\n*L’INSTITUT FOURIER*\n\n47 pp, 28 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; Introduction; Part 1. Convergent q-Borel and q-Laplace trans; 1 Convergent q-Euler series; 1.1 Integral representation; 1.2 Confluence; 2 Confluence of the convergent q-analogue of B; 2.1 Definition of the convergent q-Borel and q; 2.2 Main result; 2.3 Applications; 2.4 Proof of Theorem 2.6; Appendix A. Jackson's integral; Appendix B. Expansion of Eq(x) at; B.1. Degenerate cases of the Watson's formula; B.2. Proof of Proposition 1.5; Part 2. Summation of divergent q-series and co; 3 The divergent q-Euler series; 3.1 Definition of different sums of the q-Eule",
